Willing to relocate: Yes, within India / Worldwide (would need assistance)<p>Technologies: Python, PyTorch, computer vision, deep learning, NLP Systems/LLMs, Agentic AI, ONNX Runtime, C/Go, TypeScript, SQL/PostgreSQL, FastAPI, Next.js, ESP32/FreeRTOS, Linux, Docker, CI/CD</p><p>Résumé/CV: <a href="https://rudraxd.in/resume.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://rudraxd.in/resume.pdf</a></p><p>Email: work@rudraxd.in</p><p>Website: <a href="https://rudraxd.in" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://rudraxd.in</a> ;
